OL,3,GNEWSATwo arrested for murder over fatal
OL,4,Ae-bike crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man and a teenage boy have been
OL,7,Farrested on suspicion of murder over a
OL,8,Ffatal crash in North Kensington.
OL,10,FKariem Abdelhalim, 24, who was riding
OL,11,Fan e-bike, was found seriously injured
OL,12,Fin the early hours of 25 September and
OL,13,Fdied at the scene, the Metropolitan
OL,14,FPolice said.
OL,16,FDetectives believe he was being chased
OL,17,Fby a moped. They have appealed for
OL,18,Fwitnesses to come forward with
OL,19,Finformation to help them build up a
OL,20,Fpicture of what happened.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
